# Cloudflare Pages rewrite rules for CineNova
# Movie detail pages are rendered client-side by JS based on the URL slug,
# so any /movie/{slug} request should serve the homepage (with a real 200,
# not a 404) so the JS can read location.pathname and load the right movie.
# NOTE: destination is "/" (not "/index.html") to avoid a known Wrangler
# false-positive "infinite loop" validation bug on rules ending in index.html.
/movie/* / 200
